<title>SPAIN: MOTORCYCLING-SPANISH 500CC GRAND PRIX GRID POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-SPANISH 500CC GRAND PRIX GRID POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>JEREZ DE LA FRONTERA, Spain 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading grid</p>
<p>positions after Saturday's final practice session for Sunday's</p>
<p>Spanish 500cc motorcycle grand prix :</p>
<p>1. Tadayuki Okada (Japan) Honda  1 minute 43.403 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda     1:43.560</p>
<p> 3. Alex Criville (Spain) Honda	    1:43.712</p>
<p> 4. Nobuatsu Aoki (Japan) Honda	    1:43.874</p>
<p> 5. Alberto Puig (Spain) Honda	     1:43.890</p>
